**Common bug across all 10 strategies:** Entry signals were firing outside the declared session window (`session_start` to `session_end`). Each strategy was fixed by applying an `in_session` mask (derived from `time_minutes`) to all `long_entry` and `short_entry` arrays. All other checks (array lengths, dtypes, no NaN, stop/target price validity) passed cleanly.
